ousin says  more must be done they need to be  a reputable service like the police  where they'll step in they need more  power if they have suspicion a child is  at risk they should remove the child  the child can always be returned and  apologies can be made  we can't keep losing these children  hakeem hussein should still be alive  instead he joins a list of children let  down by a system that should have kept  him safe becky johnson sky news  birmingham
 

